{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23972","headline":"题平泉薛家雪堆庄 · 白居易","name":"题平泉薛家雪堆庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪石千年应自结，灵泉一带是谁开。\n蹙爲宛转青蛇项，喷作玲珑白雪堆。\n赤日旱天长看雨，玄阴腊月亦闻雷。\n所嗟地去都门远，不得肩舁每日来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}